---
description: Decide field-level findings for reviewResults.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Reconcile computed administrative metrics with follow-up feedback and implementation evidence. Check changed denominators, observation channels, and minority experiences, then recommend next actions without claiming clinical benefit beyond the study’s scope. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
